# marketing-os .gitignore
# This file defines what stays private when the repo goes public.
# Everything listed here is excluded from public view.
# The template.md files in /personas and /company-context ARE committed — they show structure without real data.

# -----------------------------------------------
# PERSONAS — private AI role definitions
# The template.md is public. Everything else is not.
# -----------------------------------------------
/personas/*.md
!/personas/template.md
!/personas/README.md

# The coach is permanently private — never public, ever.
/personas/coach.md

# -----------------------------------------------
# COMPANY CONTEXT — all real company data is private
# Only the template.md is public.
# -----------------------------------------------
/company-context/*/
!/company-context/template.md
!/company-context/README.md

# -----------------------------------------------
# WORKING NOTES — scratch files, drafts, research
# -----------------------------------------------
/notes/
/drafts/
*.scratch.md
*.draft.md

# -----------------------------------------------
# SYSTEM
# -----------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.env
*.log
